# Default reviewers for the organization-wide defaults.
# Changes here affect every repository, so every change needs an owner review.
#
# Syntax: <path pattern>  <@user or @org/team>
# The LAST matching pattern wins.

# Everything in this repo
*                               @Mtl-Logistics/owners

# Community health and process documents
/CONTRIBUTING.md                @Mtl-Logistics/owners @Mtl-Logistics/platform
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md             @Mtl-Logistics/owners
/SUPPORT.md                     @Mtl-Logistics/owners @Mtl-Logistics/platform

# Security policy — security team must sign off
/SECURITY.md                    @Mtl-Logistics/owners @Mtl-Logistics/security

# The public face of the organization
/profile/                       @Mtl-Logistics/owners

# CI/CD templates inherited by every repo
/workflow-templates/            @Mtl-Logistics/devops @Mtl-Logistics/platform
/.github/workflows/             @Mtl-Logistics/devops

# Issue and PR templates
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/        @Mtl-Logistics/owners @Mtl-Logistics/platform
/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md  @Mtl-Logistics/owners @Mtl-Logistics/platform

# This file itself
/CODEOWNERS                     @Mtl-Logistics/owners
